     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Enter the Cost values into a Google Sheet so you can use technology to help you.</p>\n<p>In a blank cell, enter “=MAX” and click on the letter at the top of the column where you entered your data values. You will see the maximum is $43,394.</p>\n<p>In a blank cell, enter “=MIN” and click on the letter at the top of the column where you entered your data values. You will see the minimum is $42.218.</p>\n<p>The range is the difference: <span data-math=\"43,394 - 42,218 = \\$1,176\"></span>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Range: <span data-math=\"\\$ 43,394 - 42,218 = \\$ 1,176\">\\$ 43,394 - 42,218 = \\$ 1,176</span>\n"
